OL,3,GNEWSATraffic stopped on A46 due to
OL,4,Alorry fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic has been stopped on the A46 in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire due to a lorry fire.
OL,9,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid crews from five stations were sent
OL,11,Fto the large fire on the southbound
OL,12,Fcarriageway shortly after 11:00 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FNational Highways said traffic was
OL,16,Fstopped in both directions between the
OL,17,FB6166 Farndon and the A6097 Newton.
OL,19,FA spokesperson for Nottinghamshire
OL,20,FPolice said the northbound carriageway
OL,21,Fhad reopened.
